{"qid": "con_00041", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e1", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 10.38, "n_tokens": 80, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.125, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 139, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=0.12 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国合同法》第二百一十条的规定：“自然人之间的借款合同，自贷款人提供借款时生效。”\n\n因此，借款的成立需要满足以下条件：\n\n1. 借款人和出借人之间存在借贷合意。\n2. 贷款人已经实际提供了借款。\n\n此外，《最高人民法院关于审理民间借贷案件适用法律若干问题的规定", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
