{"qid": "con_00164", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e1", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 8.19, "n_tokens": 80, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.07692307692307693, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 129, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=0.08 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国合同法》的规定，承诺的效力主要体现在以下几个方面：\n\n1. 承诺生效后，合同成立。\n\n2. 承诺的内容应当与要约一致，否则承诺无效。\n\n3. 承诺可以撤回，但撤回的通知应当在承诺通知到达要约人之前或者与承诺通知同时到达要约人。\n\n4. 承", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
{"qid": "prov_00123", "category": "provision", "bucket": "b2", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e1", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 7.73, "n_tokens": 70, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 127, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "cited_golden=True key_recall=0.50 (>=0.30)", "answer": "《中华人民共和国民法典》第五百八十七条规定：“当事人一方不履行合同义务或者履行合同义务不符合约定的，应当承担继续履行、采取补救措施或者赔偿损失等违约责任。”\n\n此条文明确了违约方的责任形式和范围，包括但不限于继续履行合同义务、采取补救措施以及赔偿损失等。", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
{"qid": "prov_00114", "category": "provision", "bucket": "b2", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e1", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 8.28, "n_tokens": 69, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.2857142857142857, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 105, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "cited_golden=True key_recall=0.29 (>=0.30)", "answer": "《中华人民共和国民法典》第四百九十六条规定：“有下列情形之一的，要约不得撤销：（一）要约人确定了承诺期限或者以其他形式明示要约不可撤销；（二）受要约人有理由认为要约是不可撤销的，并已经为履行合同作了准备工作。”", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
